      "writtenOn": "2020-03-25T14:28:40Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "My response at the time was that the implementation would be cleaner since idp_id and last_active would not apply to normal groups. But after doing the driver part I\u0027m not so sure of that anymore. I can spend a few hours this evening investigating the same table approach.",
      "parentUuid": "df33271e_a08842c6",
      "revId": "d663f3061d78e795941648a9aa0cd0659461c9bb",
